# Common start of the scenes: load the base save and wait until the level plays. The scene's own times count from the
# level being ready, plus 16 s (the runner shifts them), because the loading screen ("Press any key to continue") only
# takes a key a little after the level is ready.
1 console r_screenshot_mode png
2 console start server(h_cordon/single/alife/load) client(localhost)
3 waitlevel 300 l01_escape
3.5 console ai_ignore_actor on
5 key Left Shift
7 key Left Shift
9 key Left Shift
11 key Left Shift
13 key Left Shift
15 key Left Shift
